# Knowledge Harness (Cursor)

This project uses the OKF-native Knowledge Harness. Follow [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) for the full router.

**Start:** `.memory/index.md` → `.memory/progress/status.md` → `.memory/context/project.md`
**Authority:** challenge before overriding hard truth — [.memory/meta/memory-authority.md](../.memory/meta/memory-authority.md)
